`,e.jsx(t.p,{children:"Letta is a stateful agent runtime with built-in core, recall, and archival memory. It has first-class MCP support: external MCP servers are registered at agent setup time via the Python or TypeScript SDK, and their tools become callable agent tools alongside Letta's own memory system."}),`
`,e.jsx(t.h2,{children:"Install Neotoma"}),`
